{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for adventure, Captain</strong> \ud83c\udf05<br> The sea is calling in <strong>SEA WAR NAVAL SUPREMACY</strong>. A vast open world full of random encounters and dangerous enemies awaits. Raise your sails and head into waters without limits</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Awaits You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2693 <strong>Dynamic Ship Control</strong> Steer your ship, pick up speed, choose your course and show your mastery on the waves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Explore an Endless Ocean</strong> Every expedition is unique. Discover new islands, face unexpected enemies and uncover secrets reserved for the brave</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Naval Battles</strong> Fire manually or switch to auto mode. Each enemy has its own level and tactics so there is never a dull moment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea2 <strong>Fleet Progression</strong> Defeat foes to earn upgrades. Reinforce armor, increase speed, enhance weapons and unlock new ships with powerful stats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267e\ufe0f <strong>A World That Never Ends</strong> The further you sail, the more dangerous the waters become. But the rewards grow too</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Defeat enemies and grow stronger<br> \ud83d\udcb0 Earn rewards and expand your fleet<br> \ud83d\udcaa Survive in seas ruled only by strength</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a Legend of the Oceans</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sea will test your strength. But if you endure the storms, players will remember your name. Raise the anchor, Captain. Adventure begins now in <strong>SEA WAR NAVAL SUPREMACY</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837850?t=1771857935","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam